				<script id="sdm-footer-rebuild">document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded",function(){var footer=document.querySelector(".sdm-custom-footer");if(!footer)return;footer.innerHTML='<div class="footer-inner"><div class="footer-col footer-brand"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/logo_transparent.png" alt="Simply Delicious Catering &amp; BBQ" class="footer-logo"><p>From rustic BBQ to elegant plated dinners, we bring exceptional food and attentive service to events throughout East Idaho.<\/p><div class="footer-contact-list"><p class="footer-contact-item"><strong>Call<\/strong><a href="tel:12088814292" aria-label="Call Simply Delicious Catering at 208-881-4292">(208) 881-4292<\/a><\/p><p class="footer-contact-item"><strong>Email<\/strong><a href="mailto:simplydeliciousmeals4you@gmail.com">simplydeliciousmeals4you@gmail.com<\/a><\/p><p class="footer-contact-item"><strong>Service Area<\/strong><a href="/service-areas/">Eastern Idaho and nearby communities<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Quick Links<\/h4><ul><li><a href="/">Home<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/about-us/">About Us<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/services/">Services<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/menus/">Our Menus<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/gallery/">Gallery<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/contact/">Contact<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Serving East Idaho<\/h4><ul><li><a href="/service-areas/idaho-falls/">Idaho Falls<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/pocatello/">Pocatello<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/rexburg/">Rexburg<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/blackfoot/">Blackfoot<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/ammon/">Ammon<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/catering-in-driggs/">Driggs<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/service-areas/">View All Areas<\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><div class="footer-col"><h4>Featured Venues<\/h4><ul><li><a href="/venues/waterfront-idaho-falls/">The Waterfront<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/venues/labelle-lake-rigby/">LaBelle Lake<\/a><\/li><li><a href="/venues/millhous